Subject: Cantor Composed Read-Only Semantic Inspection P0 Solution

@ [solution_uuid] 04c02ee4-0d0f-4f56-8558-bc89b64245e8
@ [specification_uuid] 8e08875a-6877-4c07-9752-b96771fb0b33

& [Architecture]
  + cantor_sop_inspect owns only an outer request an outer result cross-receipt validation and deterministic replay
  + execute first validates the request then calls cantor_sop_project assemble cantor_sop_query find and cantor_sop_excerpt request plus extract in page order
  + the result retains project_digest snapshot_digest assembly_result_digest the exact FindResult ordered SourceExcerptResults non_authority and result_digest

& [DataDrivenDesign]
  + request data is profile supplied_project find projection request_digest
  + result data is profile capability request_digest assembly coordinates find excerpts non_authority result_digest
  + correspondence invariant is excerpts length equals find items length and excerpts[i].record_id equals find.items[i].unit.id
  + lineage invariant is every nested assembly_result_digest generation and query coordinate equals the outer coordinates

& [MachineContract]
  + strict deny-unknown-field JSON accepts exactly one bounded value and rejects duplicate trailing malformed or excess bytes
  + page limit64 and aggregate result bounds constrain repeated exact-source projection
  + replay recomputes the complete result rather than trusting nested claims

& [Faults]
  + unsupported_inspection inspection_request_mismatch inspection_limit inspection_result_machine_limit inspection_result_mismatch nested published kernel faults and correspondence_mismatch

& [NoEffects]
  + no ambient path environment clock random network process database provider model operator or mutation input exists
